                <pb facs="0495" n="463" sameAs="frus:frus1977-80v17p2/pg463"/>

                <head>Errata</head>
                <p>The following change has been made to <ref target="frus:frus1977-80v17p2">
                        <hi rendition="#italic">Foreign Relations</hi>, 1977–1980, Volume XVII, Part
                        2</ref>, Sub-Saharan Africa. <!--Revised information is in italic.-->
                </p>
                <list type="simple">
                    <item>
                        <hi rendition="#bold">1. <ref target="#notes">“Note on U.S. Covert
                                Actions”</ref> (date of correction: March 26, 2019)</hi>
                    </item>
                    <item>After publication, it was discovered that the “Note on U.S. Covert
                        Actions” was missing. Editors added the “Note on U.S. Covert Actions” to the
                        print and online editions.</item>
                </list>
            </div>
        </body>
